# Frontend page shell

Shared governor for page-level client state. Executor: `.cursor/skills/frontend/code/frontend-code-page-shell/SKILL.md`. Docs: `frontend/contexts/README.md`.

## Hard rules

- Page business state → `PageProvider` + route `_hooks` + `usePage<T>` — do not invent another page context.
- Export hook return types; mark page hooks `'use client'`.
- `TenantBranding` / `NavigationLoader` are app-shell only — do not overload them with feature state.
- New React context files here only for true app-wide concerns (not single-route state).
